{"spoiler":false,"text":"何故か雄也とのツーショット画像を持っていて、自身も雄也にも身に覚えが無く、困惑している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16151","sourceWorkId":"24449","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深谷校 普通科 3年B組"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀で清楚な見た目、いつも明るく笑顔なため、男女問わず人気が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また勉強だけでなく、家事全般など大抵のことはできてしまうパーフェクト女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし箱入りの一人娘なためか恋愛経験0で、その手の話題になると慌ててしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何故か雄也とのツーショット画像を持っていて、互いに身に覚えが無く困惑している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「わ、私だって恋愛くらい出来るわ。 ……きっと……多分」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50895"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71b8c74930dfda2cb0e98f74af6643ed2020c76134c4df9dae1057f8e87ff989.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fdc04b68c3070e984fef7a3d74f5e040b5fc36e28114950803e82a9d1003e168.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"前田恵","creatorId":"vndb:s11","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11","name":"前田 恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:205729:50895:8580:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c56398","characterName":"北上 まりか","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"50896","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"205729"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16152"],"vndbCharacterId":"c56398"},"originalCharacterName":"北上 まりか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fukaya Academy's General Education Department, 3rd Grade Class B."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For Yuuya, is a childhood friend and ex-girlfriend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For a period, it became a long distance relationship. Because of that reason, they broke up."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Currently it is an awkward relationship with Yuuya, but seems to care about his disordered life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has gone till second base with Yuuya."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Do you remember? The time of first kiss.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56398"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深谷校普通科３年B組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の雄也とは幼馴染であり、元カノ。一時期遠距離恋愛になってしまった事がきっかけで別れてしまった。以来、雄也とは気まずい関係だが、雄也の不規則な生活を心配したりと、どこか気にかけている様子。雄也とはBまでいったらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16152","sourceWorkId":"24449","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深谷校 普通科 3年B組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雄也とは幼なじみであり、元カノ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一時期 遠距離恋愛になり、それがきっかけで別れてしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在 雄也とは気まずい関係だが、不規則な生活を心配するなど気にかけている様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雄也とはBまでいったらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ねえ、覚えてる？　ファーストキスした時のこと」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50896"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c3f318a1ab24f8368386e78f3dd848c0c14e750cb35cbdbdfb855c21e03eee3a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/404a513412511b3ab65360c97ed7b053ff5e498aeefbc34c15c87903e91f65a6.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎木実佳","creatorId":"vndb:s987","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s987","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s987","name":"榎木 実佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:205729:50896:10026:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c56399","characterName":"七北田 瑠璃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"50897","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"205729"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16153"],"vndbCharacterId":"c56399"},"originalCharacterName":"七北田 瑠璃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fukaya Academy's General Education Department, 3rd Grade Class B."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Former soccer club manager. Retired after the team got defeated at the prefectural level qualifying tournament for national atheletic meet."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Was confessed by the captain of the soccer club at that time and decided to go out with him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She, herself have been always thinking about another person but thought that the captain is not a bad person and it is lonely to not have a boyfriend during one's period of youth."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I was devoted to the soccer club for a long time, right? So, I thought I should get a boyfriend soon.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56399"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深谷校普通科3年B組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元サッカー部マネージャー。最後の全国大会地方予選で敗戦したのを機に引退した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その時のサッカー部のキャプテンに告白され付き合う事に。本人はずっと別の人を想っていたらしいが、悪い人ではないし、青春自体に彼氏も居ないのは寂しいからとの事。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16153","sourceWorkId":"24449","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深谷校 普通科 3年B組"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元サッカー部マネージャー。 全国大会地方予選で敗戦したのを機に引退した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その時のサッカー部のキャプテンに告白され、付き合うことに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人はずっと別の人を想っていたらしいが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悪い人ではないし、青春時代に彼氏もいないのは寂しいからとのこと。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ずっとサッカー部一筋だったでしょ？　だからそろそろ彼氏作らなきゃって思って」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50897"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c845ad8136d7d105d240120216fd73e2e8a9fdfd6f2d058ff6e0b2fa15f791f5.webp","fallbackUrl":"ht