デルになってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分が評価されるのは嬉しいが、一方、ファンが校門で出待ちしたりするので困っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"サッカー観戦が趣味。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16154","sourceWorkId":"24449","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深谷校 普通科 3年B組"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今をときめく読者モデル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おとなしく地味でオタク気質だったが、友達に誘われて読者モデルを始めた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気づけば人気モデルになっていて、評価されるのは嬉しいが"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ファンが校門で出待ちするようにもなって困っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"サッカー観戦が趣味。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私の中の君はいつでも輝いていたから…。 だから、今だってきっと…」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50898"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8d61f89e90ff3350c9537a2ba06aa1964f7dc6a77767613f304722f203693491.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/aea49f137315c10bee31f0352208e7f40421c7c181807e1ea9afafe499967dbe.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石原舞","creatorId":"vndb:s985","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s985","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s985","name":"石原 舞","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:205729:50898:13372:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c56401","characterName":"ユキ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"50899","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"205729"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16155"],"vndbCharacterId":"c56401"},"originalCharacterName":"ユキ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fukaya Academy, 3rd Grade (※ Department unknown)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who looks identical to Hirose Natsumi, except her hair which is bright."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But the personality is completely opposite. Has a poisonous tongue and weak with domestic chores."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"And yet has extreme confidence in herself, coming out of nowhere."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Is a gamer who possesses the ability to defeat Yuuya in a direct match, who proclaims himself to be the best in the game arcade."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Became acquainted because of this, somehow took upon the challenge of helping Yuuya with his love."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has a hobby of taking pictures of the city's scenery with her smartphone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Don't worry. If you leave everything to me, it will be solved. Your love in just 5 seconds.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56401"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深谷校普通科3年。学科は不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その見た目は紙が明るい事以外は広瀬夏未にそっくりな程よく似ている。だが性格は全くの正反対、毒舌で家事などは得意ではなく、その癖何事も自信ありげだがどこか抜けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゲーマーであり、ゲームセンターで最強を自称していた雄也を格闘ゲームで負かす実力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それがきっかけで雄也と知り合い、どういう訳か雄也の恋愛の手伝いをすると買って出る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スマホで街の風景を撮るのが趣味らしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16155","sourceWorkId":"24449","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深谷校 3年 （※学科は不明）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"髪が明るいこと以外は 広瀬夏未 にそっくりな少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし性格はまったくの正反対。 毒舌で家事などは得意ではなく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのくせ何事も自信ありげだがどこか抜けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゲーマーであり、ゲームセンターで最強を自称する雄也を格闘ゲームで負かす実力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それがきっかけで知り合い、どういうわけか雄也の恋愛の手伝いをすると買って出る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スマホで街の風景を撮るのが趣味らしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「安心して、私に任せれば全て解決するわ。 あんたの恋なんて5秒よ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50899"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e06d795c4bf13f024b1dd2715952af186bd9f7acdfd7e1ada12f5fb534e3907c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5beaf8717f5846c2b20e8d09fcdd8e6f9ab7ab983ce6e23c37af5cb1c67a25aa.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡本理絵","creatorId":"vndb:s874","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s874","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s874","name":"岡本 理絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:205729:50899:13368:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c56582","characterName":"梅田 千尋","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"50900","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"205729"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16156"],"vndbCharacterId":"c56582"},"originalCharacterName":"梅田 千尋","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fukaya Academy's General Education Department, 2nd Grade Class B."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She met Yuuya and others, when they were investigating the school every night, because of a rumour of a ghost Sayako appearing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who was mistaken as the actual Sayako because of having no presence."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Always acts alone and doesn't become friends with anyone. It doesn't seem like the character of the person is like this, but because of a different reason..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Is senpai looking at me?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56582"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深谷校普通科2年B組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公達が学校に夜な夜な出ると噂されている幽霊のサヨコについて調べている時に出会う。影が薄く、存在感が無いため、本物のサヨコだと勘違いをする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも一人で行動していて、誰とも仲良くしないのは本人の性格だけではなく、何か理由があるらしいが…。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16156","sourceWorkId":"24449","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深谷校 普通科 2年B組"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雄也たちが、学園に夜な夜な出ると噂の幽霊・サヨコについて調べていた時に出会い、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"影が薄く存在感が無いため、本物のサヨコだと勘違いしてしまう少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも一人で行動していて、誰とも仲良くしないのは本人の性格だけではなく、何か理由があるらしいが……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「先輩は私が見えるのですか？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50900"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5a3598d5539ae93af0fe46b1881247d95a1c558d330a106c90048233a2284ae2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4d61dc95e75916da3303552fac9fa50d3019f93e2785ca0004ae0bcbaf6ead39.webp","width":63,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松山紗香","creatorId":"vndb:s904","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s904","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s904","name":"松山 紗香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:205729:50900:10662:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c56583","characterName":"砂押 リサ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"50901","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"205729"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16157"],"vndbCharacterId":"c56583"},"originalCharacterName":"砂押 リサ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fukaya Academy's General Education Department, 3rd Grade Class A."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Popular amateur model. The friend who invited Suzu to start modelling."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has lot of support from men and is proud of that fact."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I have a pretty face and good style. Looking like this, my character is good too?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56583"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深谷校普通科3年A組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"読者モデル。すずの友達で読者モデルに誘った本人。人気モデルで男性からの支持も高く、その事を自慢に思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"モデルとして自分より後輩のすずの方が人気が出てしまい、嫉妬しているらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16157","sourceWorkId":"24449","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深谷校 普通科 3年A組"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人気の読者モデル。 すずの友達で読者モデルに誘った本人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性からの支持も高く、そのことを自慢に思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"モデルとして自分より後輩のすずのほうが人気が出てしまい、嫉妬しているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私、顔も可愛くてスタイルも良くて。 こうみえて性格も良いのよ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50901"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/baabe081884e814925e74dfbe850c27b9acec9939180a8dfd5a66316b9c255db.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/22/22f7d41b9359468c1ed6526b59a6f0e2cd320320690b85c00aba26a0557c99a3.webp","width":75,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中村麻未","creatorId":"vndb:s980","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s980","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s980","name":"中村 麻未","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:205729:50901:15637:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c59938","characterName":"石森 雄也","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"50902","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"205729"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16158"],"vndbCharacterId":"c59938"},"originalCharacterName":"石森 雄也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Former soccer club regular. Gets injured just before the match, and, unable to play anymore, he loses his goal in life and hope in better, just spending his days by killing time. He even gives up on his love life. But one day, on his way home, he meets a girl—"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59938"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深谷校普通科3年B組。本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元サッカー部レギャラー。ポジション センターハーフ。全国大会出場も期待されていた部で、本人も世代別代表で選ばれる程の実力だったが直前に雄也含む数名が事故で怪我をしてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大会に間に合わず部は地方大会で敗退。 怪我をした他の者は順調に回復しているが、雄也は怪我が原因で選手生命を絶たれてしまった。 それ以降、特待生で入り勉強も苦手だったため受験勉強もせず、日々だらだらと放課後はゲームセンターに一人入り浸ったりして過ごしている。いつからか、広瀬夏未の事を気にかけているが、その理由がいまいち思い出せないらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16158","sourceWorkId":"24449","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"深谷校 普通科 3年B組"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。 元サッカー部レギャラー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全国大会出場も期待されていた部で、本人も世代別代表に選ばれる実力だったが"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大会直前に雄也を含む数名が事故でケガをしてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その結果チームは地方大会で敗退し、自身も選手生命を絶たれてしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それ以降、特待生で勉強は苦手だったため受験勉強もせず、日々だらだらと"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"放課後はゲームセンターに一人入り浸るなどして過ごしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつからか 広瀬夏未 のことを気にかけているが、その理由がいまいち思い出せないらしい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50902"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/97a063a7675600e3f2d410dc4ff0d59bb5c68042f409fe9e6354c316a8c15f0c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/40736506efdf12338148d1fb5d747e4c322482823b9f6ce47cbf4336ed3a1b49.webp","width":162,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127267","characterName":"中村 雅史","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127267"},"originalCharacterName":"中村 雅史","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Former soccer club member. Got injure